We do metadata insert every time when we get authorise notification. But for ProcessOut there are duplicate notifications for the same payment caused by duplicate {{/authorise}} requests passed to PSP for challenge flow. To fix the bug we need to move {{insert metadata}} part inside {{updateStates()}}. It should be a part of {{onNotification()}} [update handler|https://github.com/bolteu/bolt-server/blob/develop/src/platform/payment/payment_core/main/service/router/notification.ts#L306-L316] and called only when notification is not ignored.

