h3. *Blocking reason guidelines*

Blocking reasons, i.e. messages visible to the drivers in the app, should cover the following:

* Explanations of block reason
* Information on steps a driver should take to get unblocked; or a clear statement that the block can’t be removed before its end date if that is so
* Expectations on time when an account is unblocked if a driver doesn’t need to contact our Support team
* Date when a block will be removed if the block duration is longer than 14 days and the block can’t be removed before its end date. End date is shown automatically only if the block duration is less than 14 days.

Based on the advice from the Legal team given before, we should avoid word {{account block}} in our messages to drivers. Instead, we can use {{account suspension}} and related words.

There is no hard limit for the character count of a blocking message, but the blocking message should be concise and easy to read. A message of up to 1000 characters should be displayed well and fit the screen.

*Examples:*

{{The [X document] is outdated or missing. Please upload up-to-date document via driver portal. Your account will be active after document review (up to X days).}}

* Reason - {{The X document is outdated or missing.}}
* Steps to get unblocked - {{Please upload the up-to-date document via driver portal}}
* Time expectations - {{Your account will be active after document review (up to X days)}}

{{Please upload up-to-date [X document] via driver portal. Your account will be active after document review (up to X days).}}

* Reasons + steps to get unblocked - {{Please upload up-to-date [X document] via driver portal}}
* Time expectations - {{Your account will be active after document review (up to X days)}}

{{Phone number linked to this account has been reported to be in use by another person. Please update your phone number in the driver portal and contact our Support team to go online.}}

* Reason - {{Phone number linked to this account has been reported to be in use by another person}}
* Steps to get unblocked - {{Please update your phone number in the driver portal and contact our Support team to go online}}

{{Your vehicle was reported to have incorrect or missing signage. Please contact our Support team to get more information on how to get the correct signage and get back online.}}

* Reason - {{Your vehicle was reported to have incorrect or missing signage}}
* Steps to get unblocked - {{Please contact our Support team to get more information on how to get the correct signage and get back online}}

{{We have received repeated reports that you were not following local health regulations and were not wearing a face mask. Please always remember to wear a mask during rides. You will be able to go online soon (on [date]).}}

* Reason - {{We have received repeated reports that you were not following local health regulations and were not wearing a face mask}}
* Time expectations - {{You will be able to go online soon (on [date]).}}

